    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβρᾰδ-ύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tarry</i> or <i>loiter at</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				46
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτι</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρ.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>to be late</i> or <i>in default,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				278ii 13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. trans., <i>slacken</i>, opp. 
