					Aristid.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					p.545S.
				</span></i>
			; of planetary influence, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				219.23
			</span></i>; intr., of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.492
			</span></i>.</div>
